sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 클라이언트
    participant REST as REST API
    participant SockJS as SockJS Client  
    participant Spring as Spring WebSocket
    participant STOMP as STOMP Handler
    participant Controller as ChatController
    participant Service as ChatRoomService
    participant RedisSubscriber as RedisSubscriber
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey
    participant MessageTemplate as SimpMessageSendingOperations
    
    Note over Client, Redis: 현재 Redis 기반 분산 채팅 시스템 워크플로우

%% 0. 채팅방 생성 (사전 준비)
    Client ->> REST: POST /api/chat/rooms
    REST ->> Controller: createChatRoom(request)
    Controller ->> Service: createChatRoom(roomName, creatorId)
    Service ->> Redis: 채팅방 정보 저장 (Hash)
    Controller ->> Client: 201 CREATED + ChatRoomDto

%% 1. WebSocket 연결 단계
    Client ->> SockJS: new SockJS('/ws/chat')
    SockJS ->> Spring: HTTP Upgrade 요청
    Spring ->> Spring: JWT 인증 및 Handshake
    Spring ->> SockJS: 101 Switching Protocols
    SockJS ->> Client: WebSocket 연결 성공

%% 2. STOMP 연결 단계  
    Client ->> SockJS: STOMP CONNECT (with JWT)
    SockJS ->> STOMP: STOMP 프로토콜 처리
    STOMP ->> Client: STOMP CONNECTED

%% 3. 채팅방 구독 단계
    Client ->> STOMP: SUBSCRIBE /topic/chat/{roomId}
    STOMP ->> STOMP: 구독 등록
    STOMP ->> Client: 구독 확인

%% 4. 채팅방 입장 단계
    Client ->> STOMP: SEND /chat/{roomId}/join
    STOMP ->> Controller: @MessageMapping("/chat/{roomId}/join")
    Controller ->> Service: enterChatRoom(roomId, userId)
    Service ->> Redis: CHAT_ROOM_USERS:{roomId}에 사용자 추가
    Service ->> Redis: "chat.{roomId}" 채널 리스너 등록
    Controller ->> Controller: ChatMessage.createJoinMessage() 생성
    Controller ->> Service: sendMessage(roomId, joinMessage)
    Service ->> Redis: "chat.{roomId}" 채널로 메시지 발행
    Redis ->> RedisSubscriber: onMessage() 호출
    RedisSubscriber ->> MessageTemplate: convertAndSend("/topic/chat/{roomId}")
    MessageTemplate ->> Client: 입장 메시지 브로드캐스트

%% 5. 채팅 메시지 전송 단계
    Client ->> STOMP: SEND /chat/{roomId}/send + ChatMessageDto
    STOMP ->> Controller: @MessageMapping("/chat/{roomId}/send")
    Controller ->> Controller: Principal에서 User 정보 추출
    Controller ->> Controller: ChatMessage.builder() 생성
    Controller ->> Service: sendMessage(roomId, message)
    Service ->> Redis: "chat.{roomId}" 채널로 메시지 발행
    Redis ->> RedisSubscriber: onMessage() 호출
    RedisSubscriber ->> MessageTemplate: convertAndSend("/topic/chat/{roomId}")
    MessageTemplate ->> Client: 채팅 메시지 브로드캐스트 (발신자 포함)

%% 6. 채팅방 퇴장 단계
    Client ->> STOMP: SEND /chat/{roomId}/leave
    STOMP ->> Controller: @MessageMapping("/chat/{roomId}/leave")
    Controller ->> Service: leaveChatRoom(roomId, userId)
    Service ->> Redis: CHAT_ROOM_USERS:{roomId}에서 사용자 제거
    Service ->> Service: 마지막 사용자면 리스너 제거
    Controller ->> Controller: ChatMessage.createLeaveMessage() 생성
    Controller ->> Service: sendMessage(roomId, leaveMessage)
    Service ->> Redis: "chat.{roomId}" 채널로 메시지 발행
    Redis ->> RedisSubscriber: onMessage() 호출
    RedisSubscriber ->> MessageTemplate: convertAndSend("/topic/chat/{roomId}")
    MessageTemplate ->> Client: 퇴장 메시지 브로드캐스트

%% 7. 연결 종료 단계
    Client ->> STOMP: STOMP DISCONNECT
    STOMP ->> Spring: 연결 해제 처리
    Spring ->> Client: WebSocket 연결 종료

    Note over Client, Redis: 주요 특징
    Note over Client: • Redis/Valkey 기반 분산 메시징
    Note over Client: • JWT 기반 인증 
    Note over Client: • 발신자도 자신의 메시지 수신
    Note over Client: • 채팅방별 독립적인 Redis 채널

    Note over Client, Redis: REST API 엔드포인트
    Note over Client: • POST /api/chat/rooms (채팅방 생성)
    Note over Client: • GET /api/chat/rooms (채팅방 목록)
    Note over Client: • GET /api/chat/rooms/{roomId} (채팅방 조회)
    Note over Client: • GET /api/chat/rooms/{roomId}/users (참여자 목록)

    Note over Client, Redis: WebSocket 엔드포인트
    Note over Client: • 연결: /ws/chat, /wss/chat (SockJS)
    Note over Client: • 구독: /topic/chat/{roomId}
    Note over Client: • 입장: /chat/{roomId}/join
    Note over Client: • 메시지: /chat/{roomId}/send
    Note over Client: • 퇴장: /chat/{roomId}/leave
